<Introduction>
<Description>
<DisplayWhen>StartDescriptionWithThis</DisplayWhen>
<Text>This game exercises ADRIFT NPC walks (clsWalk): StartActive schedules, enter/exit messages, DisplayMessage and ExecuteTask activities, ComesAcross, Start/Suspend/Resume/Stop/UnCompletion controls, location-triggered system tasks, and player WalkTo pathfinding.</Text>
</Description>
</Introduction>
